# Frontend architecture

Layering: **screen → `src/services/` → `src/api/repositories/` → `src/api/endpoints/` → `apiClient.js`**. Do not call Axios from screens when a service already exists.

## Auth

- Zustand `useAuthStore.js` persists to `localStorage` (web-only; breaks on native).
- AsyncStorage in `src/utils/storage.js` uses mismatched keys: `saveToken` writes `userToken`, `getToken` reads `token`. Login currently does **not** call `saveToken`.
- `app/_layout.jsx` exports `Layout` with unused `{ user, designation }` props. `LayoutWrapper.jsx` exists but is not the default export. Redirect treats non-Contractor as logged out.

## Routing

File-based Expo Router under `app/`. Auth: `app/(auth)/`. App: `app/(pages)/` with `contractor/` and `projectTeam/`. Register new screens in `_layout.jsx` Stack.

## API client

`src/api/apiClient.js` — Authorization must be `` `Bearer ${token}` ``. Use `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` / `EXPO_PUBLIC_MEDIA_URL`; web defaults to `http://localhost:1339`.
